# The first module of the stage0 sample `inventory`, from the audit: item
# counts kept in a map of records with String keys.
stock is module
stock purpose "Keep item counts in a map with String keys"
stock path stock
stock imports standard.math
stock imports standard.map
stock imports standard.test
stock exports Counts
stock exports Item
stock exports restock
stock exports take

Item is record
Item purpose "An item's count and shelf"
Item typeParameter none
Item field count Int64
Item field shelf Int64

Counts is typeInstance
Counts purpose "Items by name"
Counts in none
Counts instantiates map.Map String Item

restock is operation
restock purpose "Add to an item's count, putting it on a shelf when it is new"
restock invariant adds "\"The item's count grows by the amount\""
restock typeParameter none
restock input counts Counts borrowedMutable
restock input name String borrowed
restock input amount Int64 copied
restock output none
restock outputOwnedBy none
restock raises none
restock effect none
restock uses none
restock memoryHeap false
restock async false
restock maxRecursion none
restock label begin loopKind none
restock label begin within none
restock label readItemDone loopKind none
restock label readItemDone within none
restock label fresh loopKind none
restock label fresh within none
restock label add loopKind none
restock label add within none
restock let have Int64 0 mutable
restock let shelf Int64 0 mutable
restock at begin do readItem
restock at begin branch ifError readItem goto fresh else goto readItemDone
restock at readItemDone do readCount
restock at readItemDone set have before
restock at readItemDone do readShelf
restock at readItemDone set shelf oldShelf
restock at readItemDone goto add
restock at fresh do countAll
restock at fresh set shelf size
restock at fresh goto add
restock at add do addIt
restock at add do makeItem
restock at add do putIt
restock at add return ok none

readItem is call
readItem in restock
readItem invokes Counts.get
readItem argument map Counts counts lend
readItem argument key String name lend
readItem result item Item
readItem ownedBy none
readItem cleanedBy none
readItem borrows none
readItem catch readItemError map.KeyMissing
readItem suppresses none

readCount is call
readCount in restock
readCount invokes Item.count
readCount argument record Item item copy
readCount result before Int64
readCount ownedBy none
readCount cleanedBy none
readCount borrows none
readCount catch none
readCount suppresses none

readShelf is call
readShelf in restock
readShelf invokes Item.shelf
readShelf argument record Item item copy
readShelf result oldShelf Int64
readShelf ownedBy none
readShelf cleanedBy none
readShelf borrows none
readShelf catch none
readShelf suppresses none

countAll is call
countAll in restock
countAll invokes Counts.length
countAll argument map Counts counts lend
countAll result size Int64
countAll ownedBy none
countAll cleanedBy none
countAll borrows none
countAll catch none
countAll suppresses none

addIt is call
addIt in restock
addIt invokes math.addInt64
addIt argument left Int64 have copy
addIt argument right Int64 amount copy
addIt result after Int64
addIt ownedBy none
addIt cleanedBy none
addIt borrows none
addIt catch none
addIt suppresses none

makeItem is call
makeItem in restock
makeItem invokes Item.new
makeItem argument count Int64 after copy
makeItem argument shelf Int64 shelf copy
makeItem result fresh2 Item
makeItem ownedBy none
makeItem cleanedBy none
makeItem borrows none
makeItem catch none
makeItem suppresses none

putIt is call
putIt in restock
putIt invokes Counts.put
putIt argument map Counts counts lendMutable
putIt argument key String name lend
putIt argument value Item fresh2 copy
putIt result none
putIt ownedBy none
putIt cleanedBy none
putIt borrows none
putIt catch none
putIt suppresses none

take is operation
take purpose "Take some of an item, giving what is left, or -1 when there is no such item"
take invariant takes "\"Gives the count less the amount, or -1 for a missing item\""
take typeParameter none
take input counts Counts borrowedMutable
take input name String borrowed
take input amount Int64 copied
take output Int64
take outputOwnedBy none
take raises none
take effect none
take uses none
take memoryHeap false
take async false
take maxRecursion none
take label begin loopKind none
take label begin within none
take label readItemDone loopKind none
take label readItemDone within none
take label absent loopKind none
take label absent within none
take let missing Int64 -1 immutable
take at begin do readItem
take at begin branch ifError readItem goto absent else goto readItemDone
take at readItemDone do readCount
take at readItemDone do readShelf
take at readItemDone do less
take at readItemDone do makeItem
take at readItemDone do putIt
take at readItemDone return ok after
take at absent return ok missing

readItem is call
readItem in take
readItem invokes Counts.get
readItem argument map Counts counts lend
readItem argument key String name lend
readItem result item Item
readItem ownedBy none
readItem cleanedBy none
readItem borrows none
readItem catch readItemError map.KeyMissing
readItem suppresses none

readCount is call
readCount in take
readCount invokes Item.count
readCount argument record Item item copy
readCount result before Int64
readCount ownedBy none
readCount cleanedBy none
readCount borrows none
readCount catch none
readCount suppresses none

readShelf is call
readShelf in take
readShelf invokes Item.shelf
readShelf argument record Item item copy
readShelf result shelf Int64
readShelf ownedBy none
readShelf cleanedBy none
readShelf borrows none
readShelf catch none
readShelf suppresses none

less is call
less in take
less invokes math.subtractInt64
less argument left Int64 before copy
less argument right Int64 amount copy
less result after Int64
less ownedBy none
less cleanedBy none
less borrows none
less catch none
less suppresses none

makeItem is call
makeItem in take
makeItem invokes Item.new
makeItem argument count Int64 after copy
makeItem argument shelf Int64 shelf copy
makeItem result changed Item
makeItem ownedBy none
makeItem cleanedBy none
makeItem borrows none
makeItem catch none
makeItem suppresses none

putIt is call
putIt in take
putIt invokes Counts.put
putIt argument map Counts counts lendMutable
putIt argument key String name lend
putIt argument value Item changed copy
putIt result none
putIt ownedBy none
putIt cleanedBy none
putIt borrows none
putIt catch none
putIt suppresses none
